0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Equal-arm balance (Robot Lab validation, test/bw-sim-validation.test.mjs).
0 // A beam 7 stands upright (holes along z, layer z -30..-10); a frictionless pin 3673 joins its top hole
0 // to the centre hole of a beam 15, the lever (layer z -10..10, holes x -140..140).
0 // A beam 5 hangs on each arm in the layer in front (z 10..30), each held by two friction pins at x = +-80
0 // and +-120: equal masses (1.6 g + 2 x 0.25 g) at equal arms (100 LDU).
